| case | N(A), degree 15 | N(B), degree 25 | raw coefficient counts |
|---|---|---|---|
| unequal | `(0,0),(0,15),(9,6),(2,1)` | `(0,0),(0,25),(15,10),(1,0)` | `83+215=298` |
